            "description_html": "<b>Store Door Push Bar Pair with 33\" Center to Center</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nSet of two 33\" Center to Center (CTC) push bars. Made from 1\" diameter solid aluminum round bar stock. Packaged with back-to-back mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/store-door-push-and-pull-handle-set\">Store Door Push Bar with Pull Handle Set</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Global TH1100-OPB33-PR Pull Handle Pair:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Push Bar Center to Center (CTC): 33\"</li>\r\n<li>Push Bar Total Length: 34\"</li>\r\n<li>Push Bar Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Push Bar Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Push Bar Clearance: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with 2 push bars and back-to-back mounting hardware.</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in Aluminum or Dark Bronze finishes to match the common glass store door frame colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold as a Set (for 1 door).</i>\r\n</p>",
